{"1699050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sanctuary: Shattered Sun", "steam_appid": 1699050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>A word from the masters of the genre:</h1><p>&quot;It could very well be deemed the spiritual successor to the games we created at Gas Powered Games&quot;<br><i><strong>- Chris Taylor,</strong> Legendary RTS creator of titles like Total Annihilation and Supreme Commander</i><br><br>&quot;Definitely captured the feel, that's awesome&quot;<br><i><strong>- Bradley Rebh,</strong> Lead designer of Supreme Commander Forged Alliance</i></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>This is a pre-alpha demo with bugs in it! It does not run properly on Linux yet!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanctuary will feature a campaign, multiplayer, base building, a flow-based economy, kingpiece commander units, as well as land, sea and air combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0c8cbc22be340afac2ea19ee0af7ebe1.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0c8cbc22be340afac2ea19ee0af7ebe1.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0c8cbc22be340afac2ea19ee0af7ebe1.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every projectile is simulated. Nukes level bases and energy shield generators hold the line against long-range artillery strikes. Sanctuary has a core focus on strategic decision-making over fast-paced micromanagement. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ebcb5ea40a9a64da6cfe374680a1e805.webp?t=1784814821\" width=433 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When conventional weapons aren't enough, deploy superweapons that literally break the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/eae12260497dbf4ee216b40abb8c9077.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/eae12260497dbf4ee216b40abb8c9077.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/eae12260497dbf4ee216b40abb8c9077.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as your enemies' bases plummet into the sun below when you destroy the structural supports of the Dyson Sphere itself, crumbling the ground from under them.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/149f2dde62473ae698907ab8096c5357.webp?t=1784814821\" width=375 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize control of Sanctuary's climate systems to reshape the battlefield.  Watch as your enemies' fleets become trapped in ice while your armies advance across the frozen wastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/659cf907851ac9488ed197ee62cadde8.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/659cf907851ac9488ed197ee62cadde8.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/659cf907851ac9488ed197ee62cadde8.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/1c18c811e46283abab2e2390059f67b9.webp?t=1784814821\" width=613 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Few players will muster the enormous resources needed to build a Titan, but even fewer will survive fighting one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/566b4cc4e871cb9862df6b2ff807e8da.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/566b4cc4e871cb9862df6b2ff807e8da.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/566b4cc4e871cb9862df6b2ff807e8da.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/e5f1ef1458f931fa535a1d1f286cb265.webp?t=1784814821\" width=524 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the enemy commander and you win, but be careful because if your own commander falls ... it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/bb4e29fa4ea543083ee71dac2ed74682.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/bb4e29fa4ea543083ee71dac2ed74682.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/bb4e29fa4ea543083ee71dac2ed74682.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/abe5e2197bf6c18dee44e5f91715bfba.webp?t=1784814821\" width=392 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale matters: wage war across massive 40km x 40km battlefields with up to 10,000 units under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/99026ff8dfe7d39ba067ae5661d2e836.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/99026ff8dfe7d39ba067ae5661d2e836.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/99026ff8dfe7d39ba067ae5661d2e836.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as physically simulated projectiles create unexpected moments of warfare - like missiles striking aircraft in mid-flight instead of their intended targets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/7ffa814d9433e3c0aeb2d604ee7602e0.webp?t=1784814821\" width=492 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2758, and humanity's greatest achievement encircles the sun - Sanctuary, a Dyson Sphere housing over a trillion lives. But this marvel of engineering has become a battlefield, its gleaming cities reduced to rubble, its surfaces scarred by endless war. The dreams of paradise have given way to a brutal struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ddc6d4a97e71969c789f9d6789b5af74.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ddc6d4a97e71969c789f9d6789b5af74.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ddc6d4a97e71969c789f9d6789b5af74.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your allegiance among three distinct factions: the pragmatic EDA, the futuristic Chosen, or the enigmatic Guard. Each brings unique strategies, technologies, and units to the fight for control of humanity's greatest creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/9db4918df993d24674cba6f8162daea1.webp?t=1784814821\" width=466 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by cutting-edge DOTS technology, Sanctuary: Shattered Sun delivers smooth performance even in the largest battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0b822af807518daf8e3452d19d7d2e96.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0b822af807518daf8e3452d19d7d2e96.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0b822af807518daf8e3452d19d7d2e96.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every explosion, every unit, and every tactical decision comes together in a seamless experience that pushes the boundaries of what's possible in strategy gaming. Watch thousands of units clash without your PC slowing to a crawl. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>This is a pre-alpha demo with bugs in it! It does not run properly on Linux yet!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanctuary will feature a campaign, multiplayer, base building, a flow-based economy, kingpiece commander units, as well as land, sea and air combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0c8cbc22be340afac2ea19ee0af7ebe1.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0c8cbc22be340afac2ea19ee0af7ebe1.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/0c8cbc22be340afac2ea19ee0af7ebe1.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every projectile is simulated. Nukes level bases and energy shield generators hold the line against long-range artillery strikes. Sanctuary has a core focus on strategic decision-making over fast-paced micromanagement. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/ebcb5ea40a9a64da6cfe374680a1e805.webp?t=1784814821\" width=433 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When conventional weapons aren't enough, deploy superweapons that literally break the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra