an></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/abe5e2197bf6c18dee44e5f91715bfba.webp?t=1784814821\" width=392 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale matters: wage war across massive 40km x 40km battlefields with up to 10,000 units under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/99026ff8dfe7d39ba067ae5661d2e836.poster.avif?t=1784814821\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/99026ff8dfe7d39ba067ae5661d2e836.webm?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/99026ff8dfe7d39ba067ae5661d2e836.mp4?t=1784814821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as physically simulated projectiles create unexpected moments of warfare - like missiles striking aircraft in mid-flight instead of their intended targets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699050/extras/7ffa814d9433e3c0aeb2d604ee7602e0.webp?t=1784814821\" width=492 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2758, and humanity's greatest achievement encircles the sun - Sanctuary, a Dyson Sphere housing over a trillion lives. But this marvel of engineering has become a battlefield, its gleaming cities reduced to rubble, its surfaces scarred by endless war. The dreams of paradise have given way to a brutal struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"ht